@title: login_member
@context: A member and the admin take turns, each seeing their own role.
@tags: login
@import: * from '../lib/env.hunt'

STEP 1: Open the login page
    NAVIGATE to 'Login'
    VERIFY that the page is 'Login'

STEP 2: Sign in as grace
    SET {user} = grace
    SET {password} = hopper
    USE Login.SignIn
    VERIFY that 'Welcome, grace' is present
    VERIFY 'Role' field has value 'member'

STEP 3: Sign out, and the fields are empty
    USE Login.SignOut
    VERIFY 'Username' field has value ''

STEP 4: Sign in as ada
    SET {user} = ada
    SET {password} = lovelace
    USE Login.SignIn
    VERIFY that 'Welcome, ada' is present
    VERIFY 'Role' field has value 'admin'

STEP 5: Sign out again
    USE Login.SignOut
    VERIFY that 'Welcome, ada' is NOT present

STEP 6: Ask to remember grace
    FILL 'Username' field with 'grace'
    CHECK the checkbox for 'Remember me'
    VERIFY that 'Remember me' is checked

STEP 7: Sign in as grace once more
    FILL 'Password' field with 'hopper'
    CLICK the 'Sign in' button
    VERIFY that 'Welcome, grace' is present

DONE.
